<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-GUD says has 96 pct of Sunbeam.</title>
<headline>RTRS-GUD says has 96 pct of Sunbeam.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Automotive supplies maker GUD Holdings Ltd said on Thursday it was now entitled to about 96 percent of appliance maker Sunbeam Victa Holdings Ltd and would move to compulsory acquisition of the remaining shares.</p>
<p>&quot;They intend to go to compulsory acquisition,&quot; a spokesman for the company told Reuters.</p>
<p>GUD is offering one GUD share plus 54 cents cash for every three Sunbeam shares.</p>
<p>Based on Thursday's closing price for GUD of A$3.20, the offer values Sunbeam at about A$1.25 per share.  </p>
<p>Sunbeam shares closed unchanged at A$1.22 on turnover of 10,253 shares.</p>
<p>-- Melbourne bureau 61-3 9286-1435</p>
